        "Same-genus Ribawi items (gold-gold, silver-silver, wheat-wheat, barley-barley, dates-dates, salt-salt) must be exchanged equal-for-equal and hand-to-hand (spot) -- delay or inequality creates Riba Al-Fadl.",
